      { d: 3, f: "Apply DMAIC to a problem at your own workplace.", b: "For example, mispicked click-and-collect orders. Define: about 1 in 20 orders has a wrong item; why? Measure: log errors by shift, product and picker for two weeks. Analyse: most errors involve look-alike products stored side by side. Improve: separate them and add shelf labels with photos. Control: a weekly error count on the team board, with a re-check if it climbs." }
